{
 "fixture": "basic",
 "about": "The Pen tool and point editing: a path made from a point list is what a script's entirePath makes (Polygon when closed, GraphicLine when open, page coordinates, handles optional); moving anchors takes their handles along; moving one handle of a smooth point turns the other to stay in line at its own length (a corner point's handles move on their own, Alt = independent); the frame's crop and a text frame's column follow the new shape as in a resize. Moves are by a distance, in the item's own space (items without rotation or scale).",
